{"id":16928,"author":"2BJ","body":"\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eIGN:\u003c/i\u003e \u003c/b\u003ePopEmily945\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eReason:\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e Instigating arguments (private messaging)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI wasn't 'instigating' arguments via /msg. I asked\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/xLegendC\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/xLegendC\"\u003exLegendC\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;to 'stop' arguing in game with another player in a sarcastic way;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u003ci\u003e /msg xLegendC lol you should shut up too ok \u003c/i\u003e(Something like that).\u003c/p\u003eI wasn't trying to \"instigate\" any arguments; I didn't try to insult or offend him in anyway. I was asking him sarcastically to 'shut up' and get over argument. :^)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eWas my temp-ban or ban really false?\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e \u003ci\u003eYes\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eDo I have any evidence to show the staff if was false?\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e Yes\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eHave I waited long enough to be un-banned?\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e Yes\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eHave I been caught ban evading?\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e No\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cb\u003eHave I appealed a ban before?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e Yes\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eIGN:\u003c/i\u003e \u003c/b\u003ePopEmily945\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eReason:\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e Instigating arguments (private messaging)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eI wasn't 'instigating' arguments via /msg. I asked\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/xLegendC\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/xLegendC\"\u003exLegendC\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;to 'stop' arguing in game with another player in a sarcastic way;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u0026g